  "body": "Point release Ito-1 (0.I-1) includes the following improvements to [the original Ito release](https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/releases/tag/0.I):\r\n\r\n* [#88568](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/88568>): Item info panel can now be scrolled properly\r\n* [#87523](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/87523>): Game no longer shows an error about layering.json when using MSXotto+ tileset\r\n* [#85340](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/85340>): Terminal version of the game no longer has up 100% CPU usage\r\n* [#82765](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/82765>): Fixed LIXA teleportation, clarified text about entering LIXA and added alternative entry method\r\n* [#83825](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/83825>): Fixed zone-related crashed on loading a save\r\n* [#84078](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/84078>): Allow player to pick up items NPCs have reserved for tasks\r\n* [#84364](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/84364>): Tools recharging from a car catch up their charging when returning to reality bubble\r\n* [#82497](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/82497>): Show \"not castable\" message in spellbook menu only when spells are actually not castable\r\n* [#82931](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/82931>): Actual NPC name shown instead of <npcname> for messages whe NPC wields an item\r\n* [#83754](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/83754>): Wooden floors are now deconstructed with a nail puller instead of angle grinder\r\n* [#84048](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/84048>): Removed error messages about inconsistent morale\r\n* [#84632](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/84632>): Food heating UI now shows right amount of time and energy for charge-based items\r\n* [#84739](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/84739>): AR glasses can now take photos and store data correctly\r\n* [#85902](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/85902>): Fixed a bug that sometimes removed temporary morale bonuses\r\n* [#83638](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/83638>): Aftershock: Lynx Explorer vehicle bought from salvor encampment is now your property, not UICA's\r\n* [#84721](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/84721>): Magiclysm: Giant Growth spell can no longer be spammed\r\n* [#84736](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/84736>): Mind Over Matter: monster taking unsourced damage with Obscurity in effect will no longer crash the game\r\n* [#88202](<https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/pull/88202>): Innawood: bronze tongs can be made without already having tongs\r\n\r\n**List of commits in this release**: https://github.com/CleverRaven/Cataclysm-DDA/compare/0.I...0.I-1",
